financial advisor and this isn't financial advice. Always do your own research before putting real

00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:40.160
money to work. Energy and mining allocations in Canadian portfolios could see renewed interest

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:47.640
as global nuclear demand and a sharp oil spike align on the same day. The S&amp;P 500 closed at

00:00:47.700 --> 00:01:03.740
7,575, up 0.4%. The NASDAQ composite closed at 26,282, up 0.3%. The TSX composite closed at 35,305,

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:12.020
